  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d8442b49ab309a6189eba22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得有机会，要不要就这样去约会？呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edc5ad96f0a8e11554cbbf5a5e57cce5861883e17152f442b1e23363ee325a27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0ecec7a5379fca132988727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我用最喜欢的品牌统一了穿搭哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4a77e70dd5c58284f66f8279f570ac2117a3d33f0529f83e800b766c7d2321e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8ec822e587590cdbbdbe9f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发呆的话假日可是会溜走的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7fd3056c02fd122af19081298e1869295dff2daedf12e7b261023a220ee5b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b3126bfce13aaeaf178a3b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本的校服真cute呢！简直像化妆舞会一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b84b90a9bc157c30326a98d5c2b043ef244c6903084cf6d90a20a7b9d9c1a454",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de60e4991c29b77518e5a988",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的穿搭也是第一名，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "66eb68a23b0ac6d9f460ae4368c39e31d4d2d5275c136363d0e3ac53b2111c8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:261996285bc2ff64e2e2743b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在草地上非常显眼的、鲜艳漂亮的黄色，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "120011f60d7b67dc05c8b8b8da9d4c3629fa65ed146957b97a8e3ef122635c6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baf19d5b830befe57143e2df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想知道让蝴蝶结显得蓬松的诀窍吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f8f59b51b235ab7204f4d235f7ceeb9e3ff08cf836a7d34a00d713f95bb5efc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfa6b688e335c332e75b88aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蝴蝶结我和朋友互相检查过，所以很完美哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "846591451d6aebb647ec534777070370ad34ffe4a42f7d086cb188e0199fb26e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5328fd24b5cac7f43142cab3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "女王的宝座，我一定会夺到手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc58fa4a934ecb2f9733f7de0cf7f738b310034444439f7d91a4979d1b1368bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b0f2101b3c4cf47eb417b22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是什么衣服都能轻松驾驭的类型哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f814d73a6333e2cf1a8a0503e219ca288df00c6b72b741a8cf940488843f64c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e190c896dddedde9f3fad5c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得有机会，要不要就这样去约会？呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edc5ad96f0a8e11554cbbf5a5e57cce5861883e17152f442b1e23363ee325a27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9f0903f2febe5e2e7d888da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3ffdf8c99a4af42765c3897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上起来首先打开音乐APP。\r\n乘着热门歌曲的节奏…It's\r\ngo time! 就是这种感觉♪收拾起来也更有干劲了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "810840227f287c60be1df4dffb6cc1d5821c897ebc54100a3547e01a7c44726f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0f7ebae2f94ecbcb4762b18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Good morning!今天早上也是绝佳状态\r\n哦！状态太好了，我都想分给\r\n你一点了。要吗？…Catch☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "737f9c5cfa9aacfe9ca1ee5954bee148dca436595c5079ca62deea9ce81d85dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c292c0126c145398d3714ce0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's go Trainer,\r\nlet's go! …有精神了吗？\r\n那下午也要加油哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "717379d1a46d1603f72d3b319bc3e9e9d338634018266e3bc232516799f4b7cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c991d82da770be7d7d5317a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我教你度过幸福休息时间的咒语哦。\n在写着蜂蜜饮料的摊位前喊“软一点、\n浓一点、加奶油和柠檬”，就是这样♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "41a905db7c2cd153ff06d039a1d2effc24c7685fbf2ce9c0e02a943fca82bf04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0bd40aced32759d31de5a4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…呐，夜深了之后\r\n人影都消失了…灯光也暗了…\r\n正是看恐怖电影的好时机呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3285824359a7e7b28e39d989252b2bea0c8fedbdd4df7feb9a1b2153901edadb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c74ad9c3ae9d896db97cd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么。睡前必须做会儿瑜伽才行\n…放松身体，积蓄能量，为了\n明天也能发挥全力。…为了未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70eded77b5b53368f0964592e84bd9498caf2cf60413e946fdabc1e9f71c726d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eff5ae5b52206731f160a53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祖母公认，爸爸妈妈也赞不绝口。\r\n要不要尝尝我家祖传的\r\n樱桃派？我这就把刚烤好的拿来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d96cee4f316beaeae06003f9db0cf42d15aa1df884d11c1c2ff8dbd4c9286ffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e26483513aa29adf034c105",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的夏日祭，也要和同期一起去♪\n弥赛亚负责穿搭，我负责化妆。\n那么，该搭配什么样的化妆品呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd408fd5f951135ad53ac1b728d5770375267014b50632818c8e077f6fef777",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4054214888287a3969b5afbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去赏红叶吗？听说深山里\r\n有一处秘境。…放心吧♪\r\n我保证能平安归来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d8fb3c8c0c7d6eebfbf0a3ab0083133520188d1fe91e033f984b04f122f7a04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44e056bcac9d2ad80d477ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去滑冰怎么样？\r\n如果摔倒了…这种事别担心！\r\n我会把一切都教给你的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce1aa7be42ca3d1e414db9aeb0437b6bbb326fc6c9ccb6a223d74c56e0ca97ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbd43eb196e6086a4e30c126",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Valentine's Day!",
      "source_fingerprint": "11835758c83c8a8c87c1c99337cb9bbf2cfe06575bd2226537f370b5d3dbfff6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16603d78936f4ed65d6e7372",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸现在还在希尔埃斯塔学院工作。\n…我在那里的时候\n他还常常在窗边探头探脑地偷看呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "adfa6e1e2bd4b7f4d3bdafe247e8121d5338336c41527874f4392e3136fadcb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee5eb6d40866c513024d0b87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我买了一把新的发梳。\n梳理头发的时候，就会感到安心呢。\n潘多拉的熬夜习惯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a4af63741021b9afd692cde9c086a75a94518f1adea9f13dcf47134cd795355",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:807928a4a7dccb6f97e2212f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "弥赛亚的篮球打得\n真好呢！…必须复仇。\n作为发源地出身的人我可不能输！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b39ea8234fa5257989df35e8cefd52c93a14e0817bb900908769ab425b0222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d7f4ae27a42dd55422948d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也和西沙里奥开英语学习会。\r\n她听得真热心…呵呵，问的还全是\r\n让我不敢有丝毫松懈的问题呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9da27a47cec705993a25d70eb0d62aefc8b05dde8d64a5b30aff5e8c94c1082f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f3837e1d3afa148ce8360ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "莱茵这孩子，听着我自弹自唱\n就睡着了哦。\n呵呵，睡脸很可爱呢…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ae2189f2d90f9a466de6476e9f61ef972c808138e996e508e1a284d25b29097",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bae39080728d38a97ebb7acb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Starting Future!\r\n我通向女王的未来也才刚刚\r\n开始…但是，我一定会将其抓住！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bc0b566db1c5f243ee8a0a064ccb45a88c8d5db9827cb4a0771ce93b30c865c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62ea9e2aee49047d04f1b4c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们同届的大家，配合腿上的星星标记\r\n用V字手势围成了一个星星圆阵！\r\n少一个人都无法完成，一颗巨大的星星",
      "source_fingerprint": "b56d74276462562685e1c6525920c5aa4643ea47808e17115647a7b1a4415a0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b59809e1f2efafa025a414d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让人一眼难忘的鲜艳决胜服\r\n…目标是我憧憬的人。\r\n那位一直都非常迷人的，妈妈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ef2982942c225cd52083e983e1909730ca22b0e06ea558f0b17a53be0e142f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ae954ff2b6c20b275858dc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件夹克，表面摸起来\r\n毛茸茸的！简直…就像女王的\r\n披风一样，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad351716cdb6c6f559d42e5c582ffd87be1429bec8fa213e179429ed38fefec5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43760425edf03f49ff89625b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直以来的早餐都是麦片。坚果\r\n配上果干、酸奶…\r\n还有很多其他的搭配食谱哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f6e3a1b18f55f652732dda63dd8ab651f333e54c0909547827ce45d973e102f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad9efffe723274c9ebd1de47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥也在小测验里拿了满分！\r\n测验对决，又是平局！\r\n事到如今我要定下目标了…满分以上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dd90d875c907419346e840f50071098920875866f10792ef7bca066b2983af3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fda93f1c7159e9fe438d2254",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "～♪呼…其实到了晚上才更想\r\n自弹自唱呢，不过那样会给人添麻烦的吧。\r\n只好用哼歌来忍耐、忍耐了…。～～～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "751fd7145b9a698094352d47e3d0afd1fdc77740c03c500accfdd28bd71a6cf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b6a7bf3e1a5d41e96400a14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在花朵绽放的庭院里，我向妈妈\r\n学习了吉他。…她唱歌非常\r\n好听哦。那是我目标的、最棒的歌声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5ee2ae4dd5c58de7712cf31c36f5e11f635cc98bb2e9a4a03fa9c8089022830",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce305a502b47febf2a1b7669",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在家乡的夏令营里我可是\r\n领队哦！大家叫我探险队长…\r\n还会对我说Right away, Captain",
      "source_fingerprint": "70e0c89fa287e47279a12ed66c6293e9081ed2b15a60395b2b838b13a181c524",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4aefd241b695a56f2866628",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感恩节，即使一个人\r\n也要举行哦！来吧！…Thank you\r\nfor all you do!",
      "source_fingerprint": "ead3e656272c2d3657640f59ca8c5f347049b34c8e35a855cec161531fa1e272",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f27cf7e5c2e131a19dc774e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在丑毛衣比赛中\r\n我可是一直名列前茅。我的杰作是…\r\n伸长舌头的变色龙毛衣呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "382238c7337795613090a4294d68f5af86f7f3ed851ca9514d7531308fd9445a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f01d202823b237325f1a9bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，你会给我什么训练菜单\r\n呢？…Oh，会感到压力\r\n吗？还是说…燃起来了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "78bfb57218af76b6c75e9417663f10a452d53986557049127a442ab332bfbaa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7f1a6e808c1d647cdcf1616",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's get to work!\r\n看，快点！只要你一声令下，\r\nshowtime就开始了哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "432f9c4f468cbd5fc09aa4f17b8675fbd238b0553d654cb52e025e1c9baf46ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fd8df25b2ac018add2d1205",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "No pain, no tiara...\r\n为了成为女王，\r\n就算是荆棘之路我也乐意前行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b99f10fe6c25835abc746b6618201786e83b6b3bec7326e193ce290f15740c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a9813029f95b4d9a9d8dfef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…幸好你不是外星人。\r\n因为…你的规划能力，\r\n简直天才到了可以征服地球的程度！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd020fd2ec7e7181b88574124928d616250c6aa9d56d438a9c2c2d40d9bb424b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9e4a1e06b602213cb9e9742",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直很期待这个时间哦！\r\n因为我的力量正在飞速增长嘛！\r\n已经兴奋得不得了了…呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "82bdc8b128dc6097b3cf972aa5e26fe8f98ca9e282548c0e93d356fb7fe71f1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:325d2b6ef0ba00b7cf5c55ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心脏因为有某人的存在，才会燃烧。\r\n如果你也这么想的话…\r\n我们能爬到更高的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07c67fe4ac72f60bb8b38d88ffe6d6fcbad23a7ab8db7656da7461e17525b533",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5330de12fc135363844b8cfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵♪我喜欢你那张脸。\r\n那是已经下定决心的表情。\r\nLook at you...so bold.",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e3f92b4bd20aad16452f11aeeef3e3a6b9b219e63ce027a957b7fefa11bd9b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ee6606823d9fb34e1e869ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家干劲十足呢…！\r\n我们也绝对不能输。地狱级的\r\n特训菜单，我可是很期待的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48578886d316cc2ff41be9b4703bd718a8fc3a748b63b30874da7a6227822214",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c030c9965eedbaf95cea540b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你会给女王最棒的赞美，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3fbdffc4cca80d36ae7f7bc233ca0dcfabcca53401295702e2008b64347e0d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:531fde7ab053652c92da5347",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挺起胸膛，partner。你可是要站在我身边的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4a63ba5729826fede3e6e2657f93bb2be2cf43c934274f4f9355c21cd23bdc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63eab2dc17eed00be1fb70ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "On the up ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "24e6a34b93e487ee9b465d236d32f55b957437a620639763190a605c12dab82b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:996ad9c9a738434b3303d75a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要继续展翅高飞哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4587cb84fc5a03c0ef84beae83388b37e8c66975e40c7fa29c4dd26167fcb948",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1408b822416f01c1806dc903",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是勇敢之心！Ready to shine!",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d8eb8d27aab852419136c24ea393223dd0a9a23f26e48ed7764fa544b81f8ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:847662170b71731d58d96193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为女王的，是我！\r\n因为我向这颗heart起誓过了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdf44fe16a2765acadddb71f7edac7d48265605e406c61db175cac4dbfc65d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:430a72b781d3d30a60c78d95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我再多支持你一点吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08000b7ee0bf874d848ffb869843ca04826c3227915ef58cbca35a63620608cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd0025f5bd5db53310bc62ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK。给你最棒的支援。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d109a998c4dec57fb068896f10b425120a0f0a38be73a81ffc5efa63ef958012",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eafeeb4d5012bda85ee1c23a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咻咻地上吧~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7234e78dbf9754b9af0a9e2c7f51fdfe53ca837c86382c504ca898f2a7b4832c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75e15d0dacaed9fd4b59ab7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噫嘻嘻♪要大获全胜喽♡\n本来我就是天才！\n找到你之后就更不用说能赢了♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "19a30e743d964590176db1e6eb535cc797349c6745909955bd19538e53db2425",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb2cb8c6a8bea4f9538ff9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "698c2cc1ffd336d58630c670458028fcab40df52e6c4a1bdcc6de96366165a71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ff3fe280fa1380ff4f8b8c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "464c5fdc2e39f69c3f953f52447eb178a98976c447d3dd5387c573ca3f5b5e2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c49d33ec1f84a321bc20525",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~我们已经是亲友了吧？\n所・以・说~……我可以把课本\n放在训练员室吗？当然可以吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6b41978a58fd166ac8e3a46d89ebc02141576a9e6f30d574d40a8e84e3af7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31541f8505deda228468fa5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要训练吗~？ \n明明好不容易才找到了爱好……啊！\n那我们先约好下次要做的事~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "522ee084d265840c0bd2b918fc85ac61557632479dba673b4044c777665659ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d3e667c01dd36176fa163fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了？ 你正月很闲吗？\n……那和我去约会吧！\n新年购物约会♡然后帮我提东西♡♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "372989975c65665f877013d99cde660fb884e0f913c35f6abc7111c59c9cf2a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f7bb6e728b493c75636d31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然你好像很期待……但是很遗憾♡\n适合给你的情人节巧克力好像\n并没有~~才怪♡ 嘿嘿，吓到了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "510fa51eff3a9066eec5bbc23e752a4c7de8c7d78d464f34cde357feb4fa3e5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75c445029cfb1c21e71d8560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "关于巧克力的感想吗？\n倒是也没有特意问的必要啦！\n…今年的也还是很好吃？对吧~！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecdf56dbf78086d443e5c1fd9d6e1cea8a4d8dadb6c6742c46d3ed5e3f7013c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64ac6a8960ea2ba82802cb9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶？七夕心愿条只能写一张吗？\n那就都写在一张上♡ 太天才了♪\n海外旅行还有电视出演~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "06be62b642bd2ca17cde7e87af98085f9107de0ab5b8fda1fa5f383e47621e67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a39466526fc2d4469d9676a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妖怪护士之类的变装，\n感觉超~~适合我♪\n不给糖果的话就要扎你了哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9ef2c9d52a03380698ab483f9f9e8b3d34cecf1b9f1b83276c0552389a862eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76870b1d8f7e4e7fd9920a2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节还训练也太离谱了吧！\n……好啦♡ 别唠叨了，\n去吃晚餐去吃晚餐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b71893f6741fb448e9cd8d141471b0d526e7744cd100e1ac82594782d8e67e87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f42a0a409c42820420e5cbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~礼物呢~？\n倒也确实有收到很多……\n……但最想要的还没收到呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a05ef3a6abb05ab54f31e637915117c2bce2459975a13948bf2a567984907fda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f4f95849b16ede4ea868a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们赢啦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "a10eb280d8f16523ce34579f03ac7706113cade3608c09993a490daf3ee11b22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d768f4c0cde64abb017ede4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "房间大扫除~？扫过了扫过了♡\n因为被说了所以就……啊！\n不可以去问小心心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a64eda9665f599c90f684c8a9759a8c4453c926665b56bff6263b00e9831775a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc257416f76b7f03dbf80038",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生快~！\n呐呐，有什么想要的东西吗？\n只要有爸爸在，什么都能买给你♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "448acf92702b940fb445c1e221e7be7d08bb95f173372923aeb45788cda789ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b9f63ed199202bfdc468acc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的礼物~\n是去吃饭？还是去买衣服？\n还是说……什么？训练！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bc35b555dd4cdda68ad8175af1478919975f00a7f92dc3df44c0c629f291f4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e6667e611353f34145c5d24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的生日宴会\n也包了一艘豪华客船♪\n呐呐，要穿什么衣服去呢~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2191939cef376be2d11d62ad352effee3b7224b607d8bb8c8679e6e1a8ba11cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53caad302630f77ff0f70a8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日当天的预定完全空出来了，\n……想怎么宠我都尽管来吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a1e91054d040ebd0a40cb4780c3228525a2c5e2ac747e6abc9529be56b190e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05a912ccaddb20e4cf2836c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……诶？啊，通知？\n哦，就拜托你确认啦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "009b0d1ea253ada54f0294a746ba8e833cebd33f79918e2679702738b0bada26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3243bfa44ac1421a1b0bcf77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说是有礼物送到了！……呐呐，\n是给我的吗？是给我的吗~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfc61dfe993738ed951300e5e15ddf08885a5ae2706c30c17944a767128f64ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bc981e9172be4dcc3b063b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成恭喜~♡ 嘛！\n既然是天才马娘的担当！\n能做到也是当然♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b2d853fc5ea38270ac3e95ec948a34043c2c7c52d822391c0789bb348f8ed00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227aca0165a1d96c61799f21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么什么？有活动吗？\n会给奖励的那种？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5801d516a1357cc0bfc49c5785129fe7c10158c7afd14f8511112dc597ac315b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5159c465f82a5b97e53a3330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开办中~！\n……嘻嘻，\n就让你见识一下我的才能吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c9a7fe947ad988dd3902129ed78a513b15bd78b117f837544594c725778f83f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da205a51f0de8715a72f364d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇、奇怪……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce3cb13489d35794f75c3c08573b9d4945b875f8ba4de242b85011390d70aed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "1002"
      ]
    }
  ]
